==Restrictions==
Cat Deploy Cost: Only 1,200¢ or less

==Battleground==
*3 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*6 [[Hyppoh]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[LeMurr]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*3 [[Helmut Krabbe]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*1 [[King's Mimic]] spawns as the boss after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
With a decent amount of [[Treasure#Details - Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures|anti-Alien Crystals]], this stage can become very easy.

[[Single Attack]] Cats like [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg]] and [[Miter Saw Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Power Saw]] fare well here thanks to the low enemy density, and of course [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can]], [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer]] and [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]] will make it no more difficult than an evening stroll. Feel free to take some Attack/Speed UP [[Cat Combo|Combos]] along to get this little jaunt over with faster.

